      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 2. Code-contract inference pipeline. API documents pass through Parser, Pre-processor and Text Analysis Engine to produce Specifications in first-order-logic expressions. A Post-processor uses Domain Dictionaries to produce Refined Specifications. A Code Contract Generator uses Mappings to turn these refined expressions into Code Contracts. Arrows connect these stages in this order."
    },
