      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 5. Compacted constraint tree for the property name. An AND root joins three requirements: Name is not greater than 32 characters; Name begins with a letter a–z; and Name consists of an OR choice of letters a–z, numbers 0–9, and underscore. The first branch shows negation above greater."
    },
    {
      "path": "figures/pandita-inferring-method-specifications-icse2012/formula-001-p007.png",
